      515        FI-day-35 AT ROW 15.83 COL 46.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      516        FI-day-36 AT ROW 17.83 COL 5.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      517        FI-day-37 AT ROW 17.83 COL 12.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      518        FI-day-38 AT ROW 17.83 COL 19.25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
