      521       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      522            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      523            DEFAULT-BUTTON b-exit CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
      524   DEFINE FRAME D-Dialog
      525        FI-day-41 AT ROW 17.83 COL 39.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      526        FI-day-42 AT ROW 17.83 COL 46.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      527        RECT-1 AT ROW 7.58 COL 6
